{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "pb6bq6qgag05lw7q", "title": "14.基于Prompt的模型行为控制技术", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h3 data-lake-id=\"83d4d33c\" id=\"83d4d33c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8ce6b3dd\" id=\"u8ce6b3dd\">一、答题思路</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ufcdb2056\" id=\"ufcdb2056\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752984285574-c2395eeb-3f33-443c-95ab-bdaa43e201df.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u2339fc11-2302-463b-ab3e-6ec94059912%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u70ea7f34-f494-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A311.3333435058594%2C%22height%22%3A145%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A87878%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A561%2C%22originHeight%22%3A261%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BD%8E%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%E9%AB%98%E6%95%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A345%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A149%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%81%B5%E6%B4%BB%E5%8F%AF%E6%8E%A7%22%2C%22x%22%3A344%2C%22y%22%3A125%2C%22width%22%3A118%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E4%BB%B7%E5%80%BC%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A124%2C%22width%22%3A120%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%A7%A3%E9%87%8A%E6%80%A7%E5%BC%BA%22%2C%22x%22%3A344%2C%22y%22%3A206%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23d1f2d7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u60eab569%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u27feaa0f\" id=\"u27feaa0f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub8c46a03\" id=\"ub8c46a03\">基于Prompt的模型行为控制技术是大模型应用中的核心方法，通过设计特定的输入指令（Prompt）引导模型生成符合预期的输出。其核心价值在于：</span></p><ol list=\"u24f7e796\"><li fid=\"u04b4dddf\" data-lake-id=\"u13690451\" id=\"u13690451\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf4231be5\" id=\"uf4231be5\">低成本高效</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u51570e2a\" id=\"u51570e2a\">：无需重新训练模型，通过Prompt设计即可实现行为控制</span></li><li fid=\"u04b4dddf\" data-lake-id=\"u47d11d48\" id=\"u47d11d48\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1278677e\" id=\"u1278677e\">灵活可控</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8de16b16\" id=\"u8de16b16\">：可针对不同场景快速调整控制策略</span></li><li fid=\"u04b4dddf\" data-lake-id=\"u0eac6c0a\" id=\"u0eac6c0a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8c6d22b9\" id=\"u8c6d22b9\">解释性强</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2cd004d5\" id=\"u2cd004d5\">：控制逻辑显式体现在Prompt中，便于调试优化</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ue2cab08e\" id=\"ue2cab08e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub714a6c1\" id=\"ub714a6c1\">以下将通过医疗问诊场景的真实案例，详细解析该技术的实施路径和效果。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u155c3374\" id=\"u155c3374\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubc04ae90\" id=\"ubc04ae90\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u56052b50\" id=\"u56052b50\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"ce29c6dc\" id=\"ce29c6dc\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua9f3d9da\" id=\"ua9f3d9da\">二、项目案例：医疗AI问诊系统的合规性控制</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u616ccd78\" id=\"u616ccd78\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752984308082-f0ec2288-5f7d-41ad-88a1-9c3b54a9701e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u1c035014-9203-4dea-957b-624d1c5dea5%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u70ea7f34-f494-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A383.55555555555554%2C%22height%22%3A224%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A289689%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A863%2C%22originHeight%22%3A505%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8C%BB%E5%AD%A6%E4%B8%A5%E8%B0%A8%E6%80%A7%22%2C%22x%22%3A665%2C%22y%22%3A118%2C%22width%22%3A151%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%9C%AF%E8%AF%AD%E8%A7%84%E8%8C%83%E6%80%A7%22%2C%22x%22%3A667%2C%22y%22%3A281%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%90%88%E8%A7%84%E6%80%A7%22%2C%22x%22%3A665%2C%22y%22%3A200%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%97%A5%E5%9D%87%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E9%87%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A668%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A147%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%E5%B1%82%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%22%2C%22x%22%3A668%2C%22y%22%3A362%2C%22width%22%3A121%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PROMPT%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A666%2C%22y%22%3A447%2C%22width%22%3A166%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%97%9B%E7%82%B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A345%2C%22y%22%3A200%2C%22width%22%3A119%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A344%2C%22y%22%3A404%2C%22width%22%3A120%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A345%2C%22y%22%3A38%2C%22width%22%3A117%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8C%BB%E7%96%97%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A23%2C%22y%22%3A241%2C%22width%22%3A121%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23dbe8f4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uf166f745%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"062f98e7\" id=\"062f98e7\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucceb26ae\" id=\"ucceb26ae\">场景背景</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u9cd447ec\" id=\"u9cd447ec\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf04a9123\" id=\"uf04a9123\">某三甲医院部署AI预问诊系统，患者在挂号前通过对话机器人描述症状，系统生成结构化病历供医生参考。日均服务量3000+人次。</span></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"23d6aacf\" id=\"23d6aacf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8fa7963c\" id=\"u8fa7963c\">核心痛点</span></h4><ol list=\"u05fe33b0\"><li fid=\"u5fb540b5\" data-lake-id=\"u61223c5e\" id=\"u61223c5e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u732154f1\" id=\"u732154f1\">医学严谨性问题</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uebc45fcc\" id=\"uebc45fcc\">：</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u6b07bd74\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uf6a4d4f4\" data-lake-id=\"u90719a88\" id=\"u90719a88\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0b3fd9e5\" id=\"u0b3fd9e5\">模型可能给出超出能力范围的诊断建议（如：“您可能是癌症”）</span></li><li fid=\"uf6a4d4f4\" data-lake-id=\"u05a46311\" id=\"u05a46311\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9ea6c5d3\" id=\"u9ea6c5d3\">对未明确症状的过度推测（如：“您的头痛肯定是脑瘤引起”）</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u05fe33b0\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u5fb540b5\" data-lake-id=\"u69fd6ee1\" id=\"u69fd6ee1\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1e8c5ba0\" id=\"u1e8c5ba0\">法律合规风险</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u78e832c0\" id=\"u78e832c0\">：</span></li></ol><ul list=\"ue9c1101e\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u6386ace9\" data-lake-id=\"u98cc0c89\" id=\"u98cc0c89\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub4988651\" id=\"ub4988651\">未提示免责声明（如：“本建议仅供参考，不能替代专业诊疗”）</span></li><li fid=\"u6386ace9\" data-lake-id=\"ue1e94154\" id=\"ue1e94154\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8a953abb\" id=\"u8a953abb\">未识别高危症状的紧急处理建议（如胸痛患者未提示立即就医）</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u05fe33b0\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u5fb540b5\" data-lake-id=\"uef541abe\" id=\"uef541abe\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7a00b396\" id=\"u7a00b396\">医学术语规范性</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u718a8b95\" id=\"u718a8b95\">：</span></li></ol><ul list=\"uc24816ce\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uea309a56\" data-lake-id=\"u554244d6\" id=\"u554244d6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u750f7ebe\" id=\"u750f7ebe\">使用非专业表述（如：“心脏跳得不对劲”代替“心悸”）</span></li><li fid=\"uea309a56\" data-lake-id=\"u99237d03\" id=\"u99237d03\"><span data-lake-id=\"u66bc5a04\" id=\"u66bc5a04\">未遵循《电子病历基本规范》的术语标准</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"4d861e69\" id=\"4d861e69\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0ff0ccf3\" id=\"u0ff0ccf3\">技术方案</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u8fdb53df\" id=\"u8fdb53df\"><span data-lake-id=\"u971bc477\" id=\"u971bc477\">通过三层Prompt架构